@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Guest Login

actor Guest
participant "User Interface" as UI
participant "System" as SYS
database "Database" as DB

Guest -> UI: Access login page
UI --> Guest: Display login form

Guest -> UI: Fill login information
Guest -> UI: Submit login form
UI -> SYS: login(phoneNumber, password)

SYS -> DB: find Guest by phone
DB --> SYS: Guest record
SYS -> SYS: Compare password (bcrypt)

alt Valid credentials
  SYS -> SYS: Generate JWT token
  SYS --> UI: Login success + token
  UI --> Guest: Redirect to home page
else Invalid credentials
  SYS --> UI: Login failed
  UI --> Guest: Display error message
end

@enduml
